majoris-stickies (0.8.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Read RTF font/color tables by declared values, not assumed indexes.
  * Fix Show All Notes desktop action and prevent import/edit race overwrites.
  * Add bounded RTFD-style directory exchange with managed attachments.
  * Add PDF page navigation, pointer checklists, and paragraph indentation.
  * Support compositor opacity through the optional GNOME Shell extension.
  * Preserve SQLite v5 and versioned interchange compatibility.
  * Native compilation and Debian package build remain unqualified.

 -- Majoris OS Packaging Team <packaging@example.invalid>  Sun, 22 Nov 2026 17:50:00 +1100

majoris-stickies (0.8.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add bounded text-only RTF import and repeatable find/replace.
  * Add shell workspace toggling, layout restore, and a 64-note window limit.
  * Add on-demand ImageKit image previews and optional Poppler PDF first-page previews.
  * Retain schema v5 and local-first compatibility.

